LOPT_input_lines.txt      ; TRANSITIONS input file name; Explanations are below!
LOPT_fixlev.txt                   ; FIXED LEVELS input file name
LOPT_output_levels.txt     ; Levels OUTPUT file name
LOPT_output_lines.txt      ; Transitions OUTPUT file name
N                 ; OMIT calc. wavelengths in ANGSTROMS in the output (Y/N)?
Y                 ; TUNE single-line levels (Y/N)?
N                 ; Print listing of correlated-lines uncert. effects (Y/N)?
Y       ; CALCULATE predicted line UNCERTAINTIES (Y/N)?
N       ; Write virtual lines (Y/N)?
N       ; Divide levels into independent groups (Y/N)?
5000    ; MIN. wavenumber for AIR wavelength [cm-1]
50000   ; MAX. wavenumber for AIR wavelength [cm-1]
99.0     ; ROUND-OFF threshold for output LEVELS
99.0     ; ROUND-OFF threshold for output LINES
 1       ; 1st column of WAVELENGTH in the transitions-input file
 12      ; LAST column of WAVELENGTH in the transitions-input file
 14      ;1st column of wavelength UNCERTAINTY in the transitions-input file
 19      ;LAST column of wavelength UNCERTAINTY in the transitions-input file
    25   ; 1st column of LINE INTENSITY in the transitions-input file
    42   ; LAST column of LINE INTENSITY in the transitions-input file
43     ;1st column of LOWER LEVEL LABEL in the transitions-input file
55     ;LAST column of LOWER LEVEL LABEL in the transitions-input file
 59    ;1st column of UPPER level LABEL in the transitions-input file (width must be same as for lower level)
73      ;1st column for LINE FLAGS (B=blend,Q=questionable,M=masked,P=predicted,A=air wavelength,V=vacuum wavelength; width=5 chars; CORRELATION GROUP No. is entered here!)
  82    ;1st column of line WEIGHT in the transitions-input file
  87    ;LAST column of line WEIGHT in the transitions-input file
90      ; 1st column of wavelength UNITS in the transitions-input file (width=4 chars)
Y       ; tab-delimited output [Y/N]?
Y       ; Round input [Y/N]?
centroid; BLEND TREATMENT [component/centroid]
